  "stem": "In the \\(xy\\)-plane, the graph of \\(y = 3x + b\\), where \\(b\\) is a constant, passes through the point \\((2, 11)\\). What is the value of \\(b\\)?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "5"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "The point \\((2, 11)\\) is on the graph, so \\(11 = 3(2) + b\\).",
    "\\(11 = 6 + b\\), so \\(b = 5\\)."
  ],
  "explanation": null,
  "traps": null,
